\b CutLocal setup information\b0\par
\par
CutLocal processes images locally and does not require an online service for inference. The standard installation includes the self-contained application, required native runtime files, and the U2NetP offline model.\par
\par
Third-party license texts and notices are installed in the licenses directory and ThirdPartyNotices.txt. Optional model packs remain governed by the license identified in their manifests.\par
